# Build context is the repo root (uv workspace), so keep it small and secret-free.
# Patterns are matched from the context root, hence the leading ** on the
# per-directory ones.
.git
.venv
node_modules
infra
apps/web
**/tests
# Local secrets must never enter an image layer. Unlike .gitignore, a bare
# `.env` here matches only the context root, so nested apps/api/.env needs `**/`.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
